    "U": "证据片段：‘optional features’ 和 ‘as specified in the EIRENE FRS and SRS’。解释：这些短语依赖外部文档FRS和SRS，使得需求不完全独立可理解，需要额外上下文或定义。",
    "A": "证据片段：‘may also include’ 和 ‘shall then be implemented’。解释：‘may’表示可能性，‘shall’表示义务，结合使用时条件不明确，可能导致歧义，关于可选功能何时必须实现。",
    "C": "证据片段：‘as specified in the EIRENE FRS and SRS’。解释：正确性依赖于外部文档EIRENE FRS和SRS的正确性，如果这些文档有误，需求可能不正确。",
    "V": "证据片段：‘as specified in the EIRENE FRS and SRS’。解释：没有提供具体的、可测量的验收标准，验证需要间接参考外部规格，难以直接测试实现是否符合。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "保持不变",
    "A": "If an EIRENE network includes any optional features, those features shall be implemented as specified in the EIRENE FRS and SRS.",
    "C": "保持不变",
    "V": "Optional features in an EIRENE network, when included, shall be implemented in compliance with the testable requirements defined in the EIRENE FRS and SRS, ensuring each requirement is verifiable through inspection or demonstration."
  },
