    {"type":"A","evidence":"optional features and these shall then be implemented as specified in the EIRENE FRS and SRS","rewrite":"The EIRENE network shall support Feature-X (ID: OPT-001), Feature-Y (ID: OPT-002), and Feature-Z (ID: OPT-003) as optional capabilities; if enabled via configuration parameter 'opt_feature_list', each enabled feature shall satisfy all requirements in Table 4.2 and Sections 5.1–5.3 of this specification."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"An EIRENE network may also include optional features and these shall then be implemented as specified in the EIRENE FRS and SRS","rewrite":"When Feature-X is enabled, the EIRENE network shall accept input I1 (defined in Table 3.1), process it within 100 ms, and emit output O1 (format: JSON schema v1.2) on port P1; verification shall be performed via automated test TC-OPTX-01."}
  ]
